[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3287630541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110480#issuecomment-3287630541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480","id":3287630541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7D9ULN","user":{"login":"Flynsarmy","id":334808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDgwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy","html_url":"https://github.com/Flynsarmy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-13T05:56:31Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T05:56:31Z","body":"For anyone struggling with this issue, until this bug is fixed it can be worked around with the following:\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends Control\nclass_name MyPanel\n\nstatic var is_first_load: bool = true\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\t# Needed until https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110480 is fixed\n\tif self.is_first_load:\n\t\tself.is_first_load = false\n\telse:\n\t\treturn\n\n    # ...\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3287630541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3288163902","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110480#issuecomment-3288163902","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480","id":3288163902,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7D_WY-","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-13T11:58:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T11:58:13Z","body":"I don't see any bug in here. You probably have your `my_panel.tscn` opened in the editor, hence there are 2 separate instances of `my_panel.gd` running (one added in your EditorPlugin, one in the edited/opened scene (it's a `@tool` script so it runs there)). You can modify your print like `prints(\"_ready called\", self)` to confirm the prints come from different instances. Closing `my_panel.tscn` in the editor and then restarting the editor should of course result in a single print.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3288163902/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3288176396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110480#issuecomment-3288176396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480","id":3288176396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7D_ZcM","user":{"login":"Flynsarmy","id":334808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDgwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy","html_url":"https://github.com/Flynsarmy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-13T12:02:35Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T12:02:35Z","body":"Ah it looks like you're right. My bad!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3288176396/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]